1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,367
Sam. Sam. It's me. You're Sam.

2
00:00:02,867 --> 00:00:05,633
I'm sorry. I don't know anyone called
Sam. Welcome home!

3
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:09,833
You hate cherry pie. You said it
tastes like a cough drop.

4
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:14,667
You packed snacks, a map, and one
coat. And you begged me not to burn
it.

5
00:00:15,167 --> 00:00:19,567
Something flickers. His fork stops in
mid air. The smile slips, just a
little.

6
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:22,133
Please... nobody ask me to burn... the
coat.
